# Conformance probe pack for gate blocks (spec 0.17) on the `json` wire: the
# source of entities for the `conformance-gates-*` packs that a same-format
# round trip cannot give, such as an entity without the raw key of a gate.
# Public. No kinds. One member per key.
format  conformance-gates-json
version 0.17.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.w    w    int
field   probe.x    x    int
field   probe.y    y    int
field   probe.z    z    int
field   probe.c1   c1   int
field   probe.c2   c2   int
field   probe.n    n    int
field   probe.val  val  int
field   probe.qty  qty  int
field   hae        alt  float
group   probe.items  items
  field probe.val  v    int
  field probe.qty  q    int
end
